[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2160.79, "timestamp": "00:36:00", "text": "一。 Spark也好不到哪里去。是的，斯波克是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2188.71, "timestamp": "00:36:28", "text": "呃，兄弟，如果我……那就糟了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2204.47, "timestamp": "00:36:44", "text": "是的，我的队友们正处于崩溃的边缘"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2211.15, "timestamp": "00:36:51", "text": "现在。我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2213.87, "timestamp": "00:36:53", "text": "知道。等等，是美月"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2216.36, "timestamp": "00:36:56", "text": "流媒体。什么？什么？她是什么人？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2217.55, "timestamp": "00:36:57", "text": "[音乐]"}]